\fs32\b Overview\b0\fs22\par\par
\par
AQMS (Agile Quality Management System) is a comprehensive quality assurance and project management platform designed for agile teams. It provides end-to-end test management, bug tracking, sprint planning, and quality analytics.\par
\par
\fs28\b Key Capabilities\b0\fs22\par
\tab\bullet **Story Management** - Define, track, and validate user stories with acceptance criteria\par
\tab\bullet **Test Management** - Create, execute, and track test cases\par
\tab\bullet **Bug Tracking** - Report, assign, and resolve defects\par
\tab\bullet **Risk Assessment** - Identify and manage high-risk modules\par
\tab\bullet **Sprint Planning** - Plan and track sprint progress\par
\tab\bullet **Analytics & Reporting** - Comprehensive quality metrics and dashboards\par
\tab\bullet **AI Recommendations** - Automated test recommendations based on project analysis\par
\tab\bullet **Traceability** - Link stories, tests, and bugs for complete visibility\par
\par
\par\qc________________________________________\qj\par
\par
\fs32\b Getting Started\b0\fs22\par\par
\par
\fs28\b Login\b0\fs22\par
\tab 1. Navigate to the AQMS login page\par
\tab 2. Enter your email and password\par
\tab 3. Check "Remember Me" to stay logged in for 7 days\par
\tab 4. Click "Login"\par
\par
\\b Demo Accounts:\\b0\par
\tab\bullet QA Engineer: `qa@aqms.com` / `password123`\par
\tab\bullet Product Manager: `pm@aqms.com` / `password123`\par
\tab\bullet Scrum Master: `sm@aqms.com` / `password123`\par
