  - Sprint name and goal\par
  - Status (Planning, Active, Completed, Cancelled)\par
  - Duration and dates\par
  - Total stories and completion percentage\par
  - Actions: View sprint details\par
\par
\\b How to Use:\\b0\par
\tab\bullet Review daily for project health overview\par
\tab\bullet Click on any metric card to drill down\par
\tab\bullet Monitor test coverage to ensure quality standards\par
