\fs28\b 14. AI Test Recommendations\b0\fs22\par
\\b Purpose:\\b0 Get automated test suggestions based on project analysis\par
\par
\fs24\b How It Works\b0\fs22\par
The AI analyzes your project data every time you open the page:\par
\tab\bullet **Stories** without test cases\par
\tab\bullet **Modules** with high risk or defect frequency\par
\tab\bullet **Bugs** indicating test gaps\par
\tab\bullet **Test coverage** patterns\par
\par
\fs24\b Recommendation Types\b0\fs22\par
\par
\tab 1. **Coverage Gap**\par
   - \\b What:\\b0 Stories without any linked test cases\par
   - \\b Priority:\\b0 High (if story in "In Testing") or Medium\par
   - \\b Why:\\b0 Untested features pose quality risks\par
   - \\b Suggested Tests:\\b0 3-4 specific test cases\par
\par
\tab 2. **Risk-Based Testing**\par
   - \\b What:\\b0 High-risk modules need regression tests\par
   - \\b Priority:\\b0 Critical\par
   - \\b Why:\\b0 High defect frequency + high business impact\par
   - \\b Suggested Tests:\\b0 Comprehensive regression suite\par
\par
\tab 3. **Bug Pattern Analysis**\par
   - \\b What:\\b0 Stories with 2+ bugs indicate test gaps\par
   - \\b Priority:\\b0 Critical (if bugs are critical) or High\par
   - \\b Why:\\b0 Pattern suggests insufficient testing\par
   - \\b Suggested Tests:\\b0 Negative tests, edge cases, exploratory tests\par
\par
\tab 4. **Regression Testing**\par
   - \\b What:\\b0 Recently resolved bugs need regression tests\par
   - \\b Priority:\\b0 High\par
   - \\b Why:\\b0 Prevent bug regression\par
   - \\b Suggested Tests:\\b0 Bug reproduction tests\par
\par
\tab 5. **New Feature Testing**\par
   - \\b What:\\b0 Stories in "Ready for Dev" or "In Testing"\par
   - \\b Priority:\\b0 High\par
   - \\b Why:\\b0 New features need immediate test coverage\par
   - \\b Suggested Tests:\\b0 Feature-specific test cases\par
\par
\tab 6. **Smoke Testing**\par
   - \\b What:\\b0 Critical modules (business impact ≥ 8/10)\par
   - \\b Priority:\\b0 High\par
   - \\b Why:\\b0 Fast validation of critical paths\par
   - \\b Suggested Tests:\\b0 Basic health checks\par
\par
\fs24\b Recommendation Card\b0\fs22\par
Each recommendation shows:\par
\tab\bullet **Recommendation ID** (e.g., REC-001)\par
\tab\bullet **Priority Badge** (Critical/High/Medium/Low)\par
\tab\bullet **Type Badge** (Coverage Gap, Risk-Based, etc.)\par
\tab\bullet **🤖 AI Generated** badge\par
\tab\bullet **Linked Story/Module** (clickable to navigate)\par
\tab\bullet **Reason** - Why this recommendation exists\par
\tab\bullet **Suggested Test Cases** - 3-4 specific tests to create\par
