\fs32\b Troubleshooting\b0\fs22\par\par
\par
\fs28\b Login Issues\b0\fs22\par
\par
\\b Problem:\\b0 Can't log in\par
\\b Solutions:\\b0\par
\tab 1. Verify email and password are correct\par
\tab 2. Check Caps Lock is off\par
\tab 3. Clear browser cache and cookies\par
\tab 4. Try different browser\par
\tab 5. Contact admin for password reset\par
\par
\\b Problem:\\b0 Session expires too quickly\par
\\b Solutions:\\b0\par
\tab 1. Check "Remember Me" on login\par
\tab 2. Verify cookies are enabled\par
\tab 3. Check browser privacy settings\par
\tab 4. Session lasts 7 days with Remember Me\par
\par
\fs28\b Data Not Loading\b0\fs22\par
\par
\\b Problem:\\b0 Tables show "No data" or loading spinner\par
\\b Solutions:\\b0\par
\tab 1. Refresh page\par
\tab 2. Check internet connection\par
\tab 3. Check browser console for errors\par
\tab 4. Clear localStorage and reload\par
\tab 5. Try different browser\par
\par
\\b Problem:\\b0 Changes not saving\par
\\b Solutions:\\b0\par
\tab 1. Check internet connection\par
\tab 2. Wait for "Saved" toast notification\par
\tab 3. Verify permissions for that action\par
\tab 4. Check browser console for errors\par
\tab 5. Try again or refresh page\par
\par
\fs28\b Performance Issues\b0\fs22\par
\par
\\b Problem:\\b0 Page is slow\par
\\b Solutions:\\b0\par
\tab 1. Collapse sidebar for more space\par
\tab 2. Reduce items per page (use 10 or 25)\par
\tab 3. Apply filters to reduce data\par
\tab 4. Clear browser cache\par
\tab 5. Close unused browser tabs\par
\tab 6. Check internet speed\par
\par
\\b Problem:\\b0 Table scrolling is laggy\par
\\b Solutions:\\b0\par
\tab 1. Reduce items per page\par
\tab 2. Apply filters to show less data\par
\tab 3. Update browser to latest version\par
\tab 4. Disable browser extensions\par
\tab 5. Try different browser\par
\par
\fs28\b Feature Issues\b0\fs22\par
\par
\\b Problem:\\b0 Can't sign off story (QA/PM)\par
\\b Solutions:\\b0\par
\tab 1. Verify you have correct role\par
\tab 2. Check story has acceptance criteria\par
\tab 3. Refresh page\par
\tab 4. Contact admin if role is incorrect\par
\par
\\b Problem:\\b0 Can't assign developer/tester to story\par
\\b Solutions:\\b0\par
\tab 1. Story must have QA sign-off and PM approval first\par
\tab 2. Verify story status is "Ready"\par
\tab 3. Unlock happens after both approvals\par
\par
\\b Problem:\\b0 Test recommendations not showing\par
\\b Solutions:\\b0\par
\tab 1. Ensure you have stories and test cases\par
\tab 2. Create some stories without tests\par
\tab 3. Add modules with risk scores\par
\tab 4. Recommendations generate automatically on page load\par
\par
\\b Problem:\\b0 Action buttons not visible in tables\par
\\b Solutions:\\b0\par
\tab 1. Scroll table horizontally (horizontal scrollbar appears if needed)\par
\tab 2. Expand browser window\par
\tab 3. Collapse sidebar for more space\par
\tab 4. Reduce browser zoom (Ctrl + 0)\par
