\fs32\b Tips & Tricks\b0\fs22\par\par
\par
\fs28\b Productivity Tips\b0\fs22\par
\par
\tab 1. **Use Favorites**\par
   - Star frequently used pages\par
   - Appears at top of sidebar\par
   - Quick access to main workflow\par
\par
\tab 2. **Collapse Sidebar**\par
   - Click « button for more screen space\par
   - Great for wide tables\par
   - Sidebar still accessible\par
\par
\tab 3. **Keyboard Shortcuts**\par
   - Learn top 5 pages you use\par
   - Navigate without mouse\par
   - Much faster than clicking\par
\par
\tab 4. **Quick Create**\par
   - Use Quick Create button in sidebar\par
   - Faster than navigating to page\par
   - Creates story, bug, test, or sprint\par
\par
\tab 5. **Search Pages**\par
   - Use search box in sidebar\par
   - Find page quickly\par
   - Filters as you type\par
\par
\fs28\b Quality Best Practices\b0\fs22\par
\par
\tab 1. **Write Testable Criteria**\par
   - Use Given/When/Then format\par
   - Be specific and measurable\par
   - Avoid ambiguous language\par
\par
\tab 2. **Link Everything**\par
   - Link tests to stories\par
   - Link bugs to stories\par
   - Link bugs to tests\par
   - Enables traceability\par
\par
\tab 3. **Prioritize Critical Tests**\par
   - High-risk modules get regression tests\par
   - Critical bugs get priority\par
   - Focus on business impact\par
\par
\tab 4. **Review AI Recommendations Daily**\par
   - Catches coverage gaps early\par
   - Prevents last-minute test creation\par
   - Improves overall quality\par
\par
\tab 5. **Use Risk Matrix**\par
   - Identify high-risk modules\par
   - Allocate testing resources\par
   - Focus on what matters most\par
\par
\fs28\b Team Collaboration\b0\fs22\par
\par
\tab 1. **Add Comments**\par
   - Use story/bug comments for discussion\par
   - Document decisions\par
   - @mention team members\par
\par
\tab 2. **Update Status Regularly**\par
   - Keep Kanban board current\par
   - Update test execution results\par
   - Change bug status as work progresses\par
\par
\tab 3. **Review Team Performance**\par
   - Check Team Performance page weekly\par
   - Identify bottlenecks\par
   - Balance workload\par
\par
\tab 4. **Use Sprints**\par
   - Plan in sprints even if not scrum\par
   - Provides structure\par
   - Enables velocity tracking\par
\par
\tab 5. **Regular Reports**\par
   - Generate sprint reports\par
   - Share with stakeholders\par
   - Track quality trends\par
\par
